From a3718c80f959b8e86d1b2abf056fb578f532aeb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin Walsh <contact.me@thejustinwalsh.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:58:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(zoo): selectable LFM3 speech voice

Add Lfm3SpeechOptions.voice ({ language?, gender? }) and a lower-level
systemPrompt override. Default remains American English, female.
---
